  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.24 Final Decisions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.24 Final Decisions. If no rehearing has been requested, a decision by the commission shall become final 31 days after issuance. If a decision has been made on a request for rehearing, the decision shall be final 31 days after issuance unless a timely appeal of the decision has been filed with a court having appellate jurisdiction over commission decisions.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
